    "text": "9 hours ago Looking to refresh your home without spending a dime? There are some great free items available right now around Essex, Vermont — from furniture to a working fridge. Check out what your neighbors are giving away!\nFree Bureau (Essex Junction) A good-condition bureau with all drawers working smoothly. Measures 32” wide x 16” deep — perfect for a bedroom or hallway. Located in Essex, VT .\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nDesk A free desk in good used condition . Great for a home office or study space. Available in Essex Junction, VT .\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFREE 3 Drawer Bureau This 3-drawer bureau is ready for pickup in Essex Junction . Measures 40\" wide, 30\" high, and 20\" deep . You’ll need to load and transport it yourself. Used but in good condition .\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nKenmore Refrigerator A Kenmore refrigerator that’s still working — both fridge and freezer sections function well. Could use a cleaning, but ideal for a garage, camp, or basement . Measures about 67” tall x 29” wide . Free pickup in Essex Junction, VT .\n👉 See this item on Facebook Marketplace\nFree items like these tend to go fast, so if something catches your eye, reach out to the poster soon!\nPlease note: Availability changes quickly. Some items listed here may have already been claimed, and links may no longer be active. Contact the poster directly for the most up-to-date information.\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
